{number: 15}
{title: Praise Him! Praise Him!}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] Praise Him! praise Him! Jesus, our blessed Re-[G] deemer!
[C] Sing, O Earth, His wonderful [G] love pro-[C] claim!
[C] Hail Him! hail Him! highest archangels in [G] glory;
[C] Strength and honor [D7] give to His holy [G] Name!
Like a [G7] shepherd, Jesus will guard His [C] children,
In His [Am] arms He [D7] carries them all day [G] long: [G7]
[C] Praise Him! praise Him! tell of His excellent [F] greatness;
[C] Praise Him! praise Him! [G7] ever in joyful [C] song!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C] Praise Him! praise Him! Jesus, our blessed Re-[G] deemer!
[C] For our sins He suffered, and [G] bled, and [C] died;
[C] He our Rock, our hope of eternal sal-[G] vation,
[C] Hail Him! hail Him! [D7] Jesus the Cruci-[G] fied.
Sound His [G7] Praises! Jesus who bore our [C] sorrows,
Love un-[Am] bounded, [D7] wonderful, deep and [G] strong: [G7]
[C] Praise Him! praise Him! tell of His excellent [F] greatness;
[C] Praise Him! praise Him! [G7] ever in joyful [C] song!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C] Praise Him! praise Him! Jesus, our blessed Re-[G] deemer!
[C] Heav'nly portals loud with ho-[G] sannas [C] ring!
[C] Jesus, Savior, reigneth forever and [G] ever;
[C] Crown Him! crown Him! [D7] Prophet, and Priest, and [G] King!
Christ is [G7] coming! over the world vic-[C] torious,
Pow'r and [Am] glory [D7] unto the Lord be-[G] long: [G7]
[C] Praise Him! praise Him! tell of His excellent [F] greatness;
[C] Praise Him! praise Him! [G7] ever in joyful [C] song!
{end_of_verse}
